FreeBWS ad blocker: the filter lists in this directory
======================================================

The program code of FreeBWS is MIT licensed. The lists below are data files that are
read at run time and are not part of the program; each keeps its own license. They are
separate works placed next to the program (mere aggregation); nothing links them into
the program, and FreeBWS' converter only reads them.

  easylist.txt, easyprivacy.txt   https://easylist.to/
      EasyList and EasyPrivacy, dual licensed: GNU GPL version 3 or later, or
      Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported (CC BY-SA 3.0).
      https://easylist.to/pages/licence.html   (we use them under the GPL-3.0 option;
      the GPL text is COPYING-GPL3 in this directory)

  ublock-filters.txt, ublock-quick-fixes.txt, ublock-unbreak.txt, ublock-privacy.txt
      uBlock filters (filters.min, quick-fixes, unbreak, privacy.min) from
      https://github.com/uBlockOrigin/uAssets , GNU GPL version 3 (COPYING-GPL3).

If you change a list and pass it on, the license of that list applies to your version.
The weekly update downloads newer copies of the same lists from the addresses in
lists.conf into ~/.local/share/freebws/adblock/lists.
